# Design prototypes exported from claude.ai/design, archived under docs.
# Vendor artefacts, not our source: reformatting them would turn every
# re-export into a diff and would edit files the designer owns.
docs/design/source

# Design handoff packages as they arrive, before they are filed under docs.
# They land at the repo root under whatever name the export gave them, and
# they are read-only source of truth — the package's own rule is that when a
# document and a design file disagree, the file wins, which only holds if
# nothing here rewrites them. `pnpm format` reflowed the v2 package's markdown
# once before this rule existed; the content survived because prettier never
# touches fenced code, but the designer owns those bytes and we should not.
Restaurant form scope questions*
